efreak-lineblog/4073380/002-aa80f5826b.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4073380/002-aa80f5826b.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n车票是塑料做的代币？\n真奇怪\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n菠萝？\n这个也很奇怪\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4073380/004-8351c2d472.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4073380/004-8351c2d472.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n好多店！气氛超热闹！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4073380/005-311b30da15.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4073380/005-311b30da15.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n就这么长着？\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4073380/006-81fb7632d1.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4073380/006-81fb7632d1.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"358\" height=\"371\"></a></figure>\n\n没想到<a class=\"gf-lineblog-source-link\" href=\"http://lineblog.me/scandalblog_4/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">SCANDAL</a>就在\n这么近的地方！\n现在正在现场演出！\n（没想到昨晚的夜市也是一样\n\n而且今天正式演出的时间居然也刚好相同！）\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4073380/007-b32290c5a6.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4073380/007-b32290c5a6.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n这样能看出来吗？\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n小笼包\n真好吃！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n对\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n这里！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4073380/008-dae99985ad.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4073380/008-dae99985ad.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"355\" height=\"415\"></a></figure>\n\n台湾！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n增田\n作为神秘嘉宾\n首次登陆\n台湾！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n活动刚刚结束，\n现在终于可以宣布我人在台湾了！\n活动现场的情况之后再说！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n下回再见！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n（附带一提）\n原来去台湾的航班\n会正好飞过宫崎和鹿儿岛的正上空，\n这是我第一次知道！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4073380/009-65d968cb65.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4073380/009-65d968cb65.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure></div>","markdown_ja":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">ロサンゼルス E3の前に</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">寄っているところがあります！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4073380/001-010baed705.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4073380/001-010baed705.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>タピオカ入りミルクティーが美味い！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4073380/002-aa80f5826b.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4073380/002-aa80f5826b.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n切符がプラスチックのコイン？\n不思議\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n\nパイナップル？\nこれまた不思議な\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4073380/004-8351c2d472.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4073380/004-8351c2d472.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\nお店がたくさん！活気が凄い！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4073380/005-311b30da15.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4073380/005-311b30da15.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n普通に生えてる？\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4073380/006-81fb7632d1.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4073380/006-81fb7632d1.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"358\" height=\"371\"></a></figure>\n\n偶然にも<a class=\"gf-lineblog-source-link\" href=\"http://lineblog.me/scandalblog_4/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">SCANDAL</a>が\nこんなに近くに！\nいまライブしてる！\n（なんと昨夜の夜市も同じ\n\nしかも今日の本番の時間がまた偶然にも同じ！）\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4073380/007-b32290c5a6.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4073380/007-b32290c5a6.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\nこれで分かるかな？\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n小龍包が\n美味しい！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nそう\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nここ！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4073380/008-dae99985ad.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4073380/008-dae99985ad.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"355\" height=\"415\"></a></figure>\n\n台湾！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nマスダ\n台湾に\nシークレットゲストとして\n初上陸してます！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nいまイベント終了して\n台湾にいることを発表できました！\nイベントの様子は後ほど！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nチャオ！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n（オマケ）\n台湾に行くには\n宮崎と鹿児島の真上を飛ぶ\nというのを初めて知った！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4073380/009-65d968cb65.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4073380/009-65d968cb65.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure></div>"}}